2. Boundary value analysis:
used to test values at the edges (boundaries) of an input range Example if dob is accept only for 18 -60 , it should allow between two ages
Testcase:
  If age is 18: minimum value system should accept
  If age is 60 : maximum value system should accpet
 If age is 17  : bellow minimu system should reject
